  "slug": "its-hot-today",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/19960_its-hot-today.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "The weather is very hot today. The Chinese teacher had three classes in the morning and I am very thirsty. She went to the supermarket to buy a bottle of water, then went back to the office and drank two cups of tea. She felt much better."
  ],
  "english_full": "The weather is very hot today. The Chinese teacher had three classes in the morning and I am very thirsty. She went to the supermarket to buy a bottle of water, then went back to the office and drank two cups of tea. She felt much better.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Погода сего́дня са́мая жа́ркая. Кита́йский наста́вник имел три кла́сса у́тром, и я о́чень жа́ждущий. Она пошла в суперма́ркет, чтобы ку́пить буты́лку воды́, потом верну́лась в офи́с и пила две ча́шки ча́я. Она поли́чила намно́го лу́чше."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Pogoda segódnya sámaya zhárkaya. Kitáyskiy nastávnik imel tri klássa útrom, i ya óchen' zházhdushchiy. Ona poshla v supermárket, chtoby kúpit' butýlku vodý, potom vernuĺas' v ofís i pila dve cháshki cháya. Ona políchila namnógo lúchshe."
  ],
